WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.008
[tense music playing]

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.074
Advertise your product or brand here
contact www.OpenSubtitles.org today

3
00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.602
-[Gu-cheon pants]
-Gu-cheon.

4
00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.856
Are you all right?

5
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.361
There was a reason why the Crown Prince
had lured the plague spirits right to us.

6
00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.074
A great calamity
is about to befall the entire palace.

7
00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:42.125
-[Queen breathes shakily]
-[music fades]

8
00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.630
-[unsettling music playing]
-[murmuring]

9
00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:24.876
[man 1] I apologize.
Your Majesty. that seat belongs to…

10
00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.882
[unsettling music intensifies]

11
00:01:44.562 --> 00:01:47.107
[Queen] As you well know.
His Majesty's life

12
00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:50.485
currently stands in grave peril.

13
00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:53.154
Your Majesty. that is just not true.

14
00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:56.491
I know that the spirit still wishes
to kill the King.

15
00:01:58.743 --> 00:02:02.372
I arrived here already knowing that.
Chief Royal Secretary.

16
00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:08.962
There is no one else but me who can
take his place on this empty throne.

17
00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.714
I am the only one.

18
00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:17.512
It is only I
who can save the abundance altar

19
00:02:17.595 --> 00:02:18.972
and the Jongmyo Shrine!

20
00:02:19.055 --> 00:02:20.849
I will save it all!

21
00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:23.101
-Mark my every word!
-[staff slams]

22
00:02:23.768 --> 00:02:25.228
I alone

23
00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.439
will protect it all.

24
00:02:28.523 --> 00:02:31.192
-I alone will protect it all.
-[staff slams]

25
00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.403
I must…

26
00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.613
[music swells]

27
00:02:35.697 --> 00:02:37.574
-[man 2] Left State Councillor.
-Councillor.

28
00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:41.619
-[Queen gasping]
-[man 2] Councillor!

29
00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:44.414
-[man 3] Councillor.
-[man 2] What is happening to him?

30
00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.291
Left State Councillor.

31
00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:48.376
[gasps. groans]

32
00:02:50.044 --> 00:02:51.713
[spectral scream]

33
00:02:51.796 --> 00:02:53.798
-[women screaming]
-[tense music playing]

34
00:02:57.302 --> 00:02:58.344
[blade rasps]

35
00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:05.435
[screaming continues]

36
00:03:12.066 --> 00:03:14.068
[tense music swells]

37
00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:18.740
[spectral screams]

38
00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:20.325
[spectral whispering]

39
00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:39.135
THE EAST PALACE

40
00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:41.262
[Saeng-gang muffled] Do you believe
what happened in the palace

41
00:03:41.346 --> 00:03:43.139
is tied to the Crown Prince?

42
00:03:44.682 --> 00:03:45.934
Gu-cheon?

43
00:03:47.143 --> 00:03:48.144
[clearly] Gu-cheon.

44
00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:50.230
[Gu-cheon breathes deeply]

45
00:03:51.481 --> 00:03:53.524
Sorry. what did you just say?

46
00:03:54.776 --> 00:03:58.321
That the palace feels off right now.
You don't look any better either.

47
00:03:59.948 --> 00:04:01.115
[Gu-cheon sighs]

48
00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:04.577
It's because the Crown Prince
has grown stronger.

49
00:04:08.206 --> 00:04:10.124
That is why I must seal him in here.

50
00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:13.002
Seal him?
Without sending him to the afterlife?

51
00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:14.837
That will be impossible to do now.

52
00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:17.465
Once the plague spirits' souls
are devoured. they'll be entangled.

53
00:04:19.717 --> 00:04:21.010
Oh. for heaven's sake.

54
00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:24.264
Don't look at me
as though I'm about to die.

55
00:04:27.558 --> 00:04:29.435
You should stop frowning.
It makes you look ugly.

56
00:04:29.519 --> 00:04:32.605
You haven't looked yourself
since you acquired the gwi-mae's eyes.

57
00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.650
Just like the well gwi-mae.
you will become--

58
00:04:35.733 --> 00:04:37.068
Are you afraid that if I do this.

59
00:04:37.151 --> 00:04:39.612
I'll lose my mind
and kill someone out there?

60
00:04:42.865 --> 00:04:44.659
That will not happen.

61
00:04:44.742 --> 00:04:45.743
[gentle music playing]

62
00:04:45.827 --> 00:04:49.998
Sealing is a more useful method.
making it simpler to destroy them.

63
00:04:50.581 --> 00:04:52.417
All I have to do is seal him in here.

64
00:04:54.252 --> 00:04:55.628
And that will work?

65
00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:58.631
The appeasement rite will be very helpful.

66
00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:03.761
If we soothe
the souls of the plague spirits.

67
00:05:03.845 --> 00:05:05.930
we can weaken the Crown Prince's powers.

68
00:05:08.391 --> 00:05:10.601
I will walk you back to your quarters.
Let us go together.

69
00:05:10.685 --> 00:05:12.937
No need to. Do I look ill to you?

70
00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:18.776
Yes. because you are.

71
00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:21.571
[door opens]

72
00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:23.740
[gentle music continues]

73
00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:25.533
It all comes down to this.

74
00:05:25.616 --> 00:05:27.618
By tonight. this will all end.

75
00:05:28.119 --> 00:05:31.289
That's right.
Whether it becomes porridge or rice.

76
00:05:33.791 --> 00:05:36.753
What will you do when this is over
and you leave the palace?

77
00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:38.254
[Gu-cheon] Hmm…

78
00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:40.048
Get dead drunk. I suppose.

79
00:05:40.131 --> 00:05:42.216
-And sleep for three or four days.
-[chuckles]

80
00:05:42.967 --> 00:05:44.802
[Saeng-gang] No. I didn't mean like that.

81
00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:47.013
How do you wanna live?

82
00:05:47.638 --> 00:05:49.515
What do you wanna do with your life?

83
00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.686
I've never thought about it.

84
00:05:54.645 --> 00:05:56.230
But I will return to the temple.

85
00:05:56.314 --> 00:05:58.441
[Saeng-gang chuckles] Really?

86
00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:02.111
You said you hated the head monk there.
and yet you wanna go back?

87
00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:07.492
The thing is. about 2.000 yards
to the southeast of the temple.

88
00:06:07.575 --> 00:06:10.161
there's a river
that runs along a sheer cliff.

89
00:06:11.496 --> 00:06:12.789
Right near there…

90
00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:17.126
is where my mother died.

91
00:06:20.296 --> 00:06:23.257
So even in death.
I cannot leave the temple.

92
00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.305
I truly am sorry.

93
00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:31.224
[music fades]

94
00:06:34.727 --> 00:06:36.979
In order to solve this case. I. uh…

95
00:06:38.398 --> 00:06:41.526
-I pulled someone in who didn't--
-You're only now beating that drum?

96
00:06:41.609 --> 00:06:42.860
After using me?

97
00:06:42.944 --> 00:06:44.320
[Saeng-gang scoffs]

98
00:06:44.404 --> 00:06:48.866
You have such a talent for telling someone
the meanest. most hurtful things.

99
00:06:49.367 --> 00:06:51.786
And after working up the courage
to be honest with you…

100
00:06:52.286 --> 00:06:53.496
[unsettling music playing]

101
00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:59.502
[distorted spectral voice]
Tonight. it will be you who dies.

102
00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:02.880
The one who failed to die with his mother.

103
00:07:02.964 --> 00:07:05.758
The one who should not be allowed to live.

104
00:07:05.842 --> 00:07:08.761
The one who is neither man nor spirit.

105
00:07:08.845 --> 00:07:11.931
Tonight. it will be you who dies.

106
00:07:12.014 --> 00:07:18.104
[distorted] Tonight.
it will be you who dies.

107
00:07:19.147 --> 00:07:24.152
The one who must die alongside his mother

108
00:07:24.235 --> 00:07:28.823
will be the one to die tonight.

109
00:07:35.329 --> 00:07:37.999
What did the emaciated gwi-mae just say?

110
00:07:41.919 --> 00:07:48.468
[shaman] ♪ <i>Turtle. turtle </i>♪

111
00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:54.557
♪ <i>Poke your head out </i>♪

112
00:07:55.141 --> 00:08:00.313
♪ <i>If you do not </i>♪

113
00:08:00.813 --> 00:08:06.360
♪ <i>I will roast you and eat you up </i>♪

114
00:08:06.861 --> 00:08:08.446
[Saeng-gang] Is it almost done?

115
00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:11.616
The ritual will begin
at the Hour of the Ox.

116
00:08:12.116 --> 00:08:13.576
[Gu-cheon] It's nearly ready.

117
00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.162
[clatter. scraping]

118
00:08:33.721 --> 00:08:35.389
I have been thinking.

119
00:08:37.808 --> 00:08:40.937
I shall go with you
to that realm to help you.

120
00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:43.689
[gentle music playing]

121
00:08:44.982 --> 00:08:47.276
{\an8}Have I not constantly told you

122
00:08:47.777 --> 00:08:49.987
{\an8}that if you go in there. you will die?

123
00:08:50.905 --> 00:08:52.698
{\an8}Don't even consider it.

124
00:08:58.871 --> 00:08:59.956
[Gu-cheon blows air]

125
00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:03.543
[Gu-cheon sighs] It's all set.

126
00:09:05.294 --> 00:09:06.587
I'll get going now.

127
00:09:07.088 --> 00:09:08.506
Wait a moment.

128
00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:16.264
Drink this

129
00:09:17.139 --> 00:09:19.100
so your yang energy is replenished.

130
00:09:19.183 --> 00:09:20.643
The ingredients are valuable.

131
00:09:22.603 --> 00:09:25.523
Good heavens.
You didn't have to do this now.

132
00:09:29.735 --> 00:09:32.321
You should've given it to me sooner.

133
00:09:34.407 --> 00:09:37.368
Ugh. This medicine is so bitter. [coughs]

134
00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:41.831
Is there anything I can do to help?

135
00:09:45.626 --> 00:09:46.919
I'm sorry. no.

136
00:09:48.504 --> 00:09:49.839
Princess.

137
00:09:49.922 --> 00:09:52.758
The Crown Prince is after you as well.
Don't forget that.

138
00:09:54.677 --> 00:09:56.554
So keep yourself hidden away.

139
00:10:05.605 --> 00:10:06.772
[music fades]

140
00:10:06.856 --> 00:10:07.815
What is wrong?

141
00:10:10.901 --> 00:10:12.278
Earlier today.

142
00:10:13.529 --> 00:10:15.740
I may have gone to see my grandmother.

143
00:10:15.823 --> 00:10:17.241
Why did you go there?

144
00:10:17.908 --> 00:10:19.910
You made her seem like your enemy.

145
00:10:20.953 --> 00:10:22.955
[ominous music playing]

146
00:10:38.471 --> 00:10:41.515
It will take half a day for you
to wake up after this.

147
00:10:41.599 --> 00:10:42.975
[Gu-cheon breathes shakily]

148
00:10:47.021 --> 00:10:49.315
[labored breathing] Why?

149
00:10:51.025 --> 00:10:53.778
-Why?
-I don't know. I honestly don't.

150
00:10:54.695 --> 00:10:57.573
The moment I heard the gwi-mae mention
that you would meet your end.

151
00:10:57.657 --> 00:10:59.950
my body moved before I was able to stop.

152
00:11:00.034 --> 00:11:02.828
[Gu-cheon breathing shakily]

153
00:11:04.747 --> 00:11:06.666
[panting]

154
00:11:06.749 --> 00:11:11.253
You are the only one in this palace
I can trust and rely on. That is why…

155
00:11:13.673 --> 00:11:16.133
I will make sure
you don't meet your end tonight.

156
00:11:17.051 --> 00:11:19.053
[labored breathing]

157
00:11:21.055 --> 00:11:23.599
[Saeng-gang] I will save you.
even if that means

158
00:11:24.308 --> 00:11:26.560
sacrificing my own life for yours.

159
00:11:30.898 --> 00:11:32.525
[music intensifies]

160
00:11:41.867 --> 00:11:44.203
Thank you for always protecting me.

161
00:11:52.294 --> 00:11:54.130
So from now on.

162
00:11:55.548 --> 00:11:57.675
I will take your place in this battle.

163
00:12:00.469 --> 00:12:02.471
[dark music playing]

164
00:12:23.701 --> 00:12:26.495
[Iksang] The appeasement rite
will begin soon.

165
00:12:26.579 --> 00:12:29.248
It seems the shaman has a strategy.

166
00:12:43.471 --> 00:12:45.473
[dark music continues]

167
00:13:26.722 --> 00:13:28.849
-[King coughs]
-Your Majesty.

168
00:13:29.642 --> 00:13:31.310
Do not make a scene.

169
00:13:40.069 --> 00:13:41.320
[rattling]

170
00:13:44.573 --> 00:13:47.117
-[wind whistling]
-[spectral voice echoing]

171
00:13:47.201 --> 00:13:48.452
[panicked murmuring]

172
00:13:49.829 --> 00:13:51.997
I know the Crown Prince is here.

173
00:14:01.423 --> 00:14:03.425
[spectral voice echoing]

174
00:14:08.597 --> 00:14:10.599
[dark tense music playing]

175
00:14:29.618 --> 00:14:30.953
[music intensifies]

176
00:14:50.014 --> 00:14:52.516
[sizzling]

177
00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:54.602
[music subsides]

178
00:15:00.566 --> 00:15:03.235
So you did become
an ak-gwi after all. brother.

179
00:15:03.736 --> 00:15:04.862
[intriguing music playing]

180
00:15:04.945 --> 00:15:06.989
Do not think of interfering.

181
00:15:07.656 --> 00:15:09.950
All of that bitterness
you must be feeling.

182
00:15:10.784 --> 00:15:12.453
I understand it myself.

183
00:15:13.621 --> 00:15:16.749
A man who was killed by his own father.
it's only natural you'd feel that way.

184
00:15:16.832 --> 00:15:18.250
-[rumbling]
-[Saeng-gang gasps]

185
00:15:18.334 --> 00:15:20.336
-[snarling]
-[gasps]

186
00:15:21.003 --> 00:15:22.463
[Saeng-gang] Brother. stop!

187
00:15:26.216 --> 00:15:29.094
He abandoned me
for hearing the voices of spirits. too.

188
00:15:30.346 --> 00:15:32.431
and my mother died
because of him. brother!

189
00:15:32.514 --> 00:15:35.267
I hate Father as much as you do!
Look at me!

190
00:15:36.226 --> 00:15:38.479
[tense dramatic music playing]

191
00:15:38.562 --> 00:15:39.939
[groans]

192
00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:42.858
[coughing. grunts]

193
00:15:43.359 --> 00:15:45.527
-I told you not to interfere.
-[Saeng-gang gasps]

194
00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:51.450
[music swells]

195
00:15:51.533 --> 00:15:54.495
-[Saeng-gang grunts. gasps]
-[music subsides]

196
00:15:57.539 --> 00:16:00.292
-[Saeng-gang pants]
-[tense music playing]

197
00:16:03.337 --> 00:16:05.339
[tense percussive music playing]

198
00:16:07.716 --> 00:16:09.843
[distant spectral screams]

199
00:16:09.927 --> 00:16:11.387
[squelching]

200
00:16:20.688 --> 00:16:21.814
[Saeng-gang gasps]

201
00:16:23.315 --> 00:16:24.984
[Saeng-gang grunts. groans]

202
00:16:27.111 --> 00:16:28.195
[groans]

203
00:16:28.779 --> 00:16:31.156
-[music intensifies]
-[shaman breathing heavily]

204
00:16:45.504 --> 00:16:47.172
[groans]

205
00:16:51.969 --> 00:16:53.971
[dramatic percussive music playing]

206
00:16:55.305 --> 00:16:56.640
[squelching]

207
00:17:02.438 --> 00:17:03.814
[groans. grunts]

208
00:17:03.897 --> 00:17:06.692
-[music subsides]
-[spectral voice echoes]

209
00:17:07.276 --> 00:17:08.402
[Gu-cheon pants]

210
00:17:08.485 --> 00:17:10.487
[somber music playing]

211
00:17:24.001 --> 00:17:25.544
[breathing shakily]

212
00:17:27.421 --> 00:17:29.590
[strained. labored breathing]

213
00:17:32.676 --> 00:17:33.969
[Gu-cheon groans. grunts]

214
00:17:37.222 --> 00:17:40.017
[breathing shakily]

215
00:17:57.534 --> 00:17:58.577
[King sighs]

216
00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:02.581
-[squelching]
-[Saeng-gang groans]

217
00:18:03.457 --> 00:18:04.958
[Crown Prince sighs]

218
00:18:05.042 --> 00:18:06.251
[Saeng-gang groans]

219
00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:09.213
[Saeng-gang coughs]

220
00:18:09.797 --> 00:18:11.090
[wind whistles]

221
00:18:13.425 --> 00:18:15.385
-[Saeng-gang winces]
-[blade rasps]

222
00:18:16.261 --> 00:18:17.304
[groans]

223
00:18:18.597 --> 00:18:19.640
[pants]

224
00:18:33.362 --> 00:18:34.530
[Saeng-gang groans]

225
00:18:37.825 --> 00:18:40.244
[Saeng-gang groaning]

226
00:18:40.327 --> 00:18:41.954
-[squelching]
-[gasps]

227
00:18:48.877 --> 00:18:49.962
[groans]

228
00:18:50.879 --> 00:18:53.173
[grunts. groans]

229
00:18:54.216 --> 00:18:55.425
[gasps]

230
00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.762
[labored breathing]

231
00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.769
[Saeng-gang] <i>I will make sure</i>
<i>you don't meet your end tonight.</i>

232
00:19:06.812 --> 00:19:10.357
<i>Even if that means sacrificing</i>
<i>my own life for yours.</i>

233
00:19:19.283 --> 00:19:20.951
[exhales shakily]

234
00:19:21.702 --> 00:19:22.744
[sniffles]

235
00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:24.079
[breathes shakily]

236
00:19:25.539 --> 00:19:26.665
[clatter]

237
00:19:28.458 --> 00:19:30.043
[whimpers]

238
00:19:36.008 --> 00:19:38.177
[whimpers. purrs]

239
00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.221
[whimpering continues]

240
00:19:43.223 --> 00:19:44.975
Are you telling me not to do it?

241
00:19:46.393 --> 00:19:48.103
[squeaks]

242
00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.359
[Gu-cheon sighs]

243
00:19:55.777 --> 00:19:58.655
This is the only way
I'm able to save the Princess.

244
00:20:02.159 --> 00:20:03.243
[squeaks]

245
00:20:03.327 --> 00:20:05.329
[Gu-cheon] She was willing
to risk her life for me.

246
00:20:06.788 --> 00:20:08.290
so I must answer that resolve.

247
00:20:15.547 --> 00:20:17.174
-[slicing]
-[Gu-cheon groans]

248
00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:21.178
[Gu-cheon gasps]

249
00:20:26.058 --> 00:20:28.060
[Saeng-gang breathing heavily]

250
00:20:29.436 --> 00:20:30.520
[inhales sharply]

251
00:20:30.604 --> 00:20:32.606
[solemn music playing]

252
00:20:43.533 --> 00:20:45.535
[solemn music continues]

253
00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.842
[music intensifies]

254
00:21:10.143 --> 00:21:11.645
[King] <i>Humans</i>

255
00:21:12.688 --> 00:21:16.358
<i>advance towards death</i>
<i>from the moment they are born.</i>

256
00:21:19.111 --> 00:21:21.363
<i>No matter what one's status is.</i>

257
00:21:21.863 --> 00:21:24.116
<i>or what kind of person they are.</i>

258
00:21:25.158 --> 00:21:26.743
<i>none of it matters.</i>

259
00:21:31.123 --> 00:21:35.419
<i>At the end of every fate.</i>
<i>death is equal to all.</i>

260
00:21:36.336 --> 00:21:38.839
<i>So there is no reason to grieve</i>

261
00:21:38.922 --> 00:21:40.841
<i>or feel wronged by it.</i>

262
00:21:53.312 --> 00:21:56.023
-[unsettling music playing]
-[distant jingling]

263
00:22:10.787 --> 00:22:12.789
[distant snarling]

264
00:22:20.547 --> 00:22:22.549
[snarling]

265
00:22:24.968 --> 00:22:26.970
[water splashes gently]

266
00:22:42.069 --> 00:22:44.071
[unsettling music continues]

267
00:22:54.706 --> 00:22:58.210
[snarl resonating]

268
00:23:00.837 --> 00:23:03.548
[Gu-cheon] So this is why
the palace reeks of yin energy.

269
00:23:04.841 --> 00:23:06.593
Was all of this you.

270
00:23:07.677 --> 00:23:09.054
Supreme Gwi-mae?

271
00:23:09.971 --> 00:23:11.973
[eerie sound resonates]

272
00:23:12.599 --> 00:23:16.561
I will comply with what you are asking.

273
00:23:16.645 --> 00:23:17.771
In return.

274
00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:20.982
I request the power you hold

275
00:23:22.401 --> 00:23:24.277
so I can save the Princess.

276
00:23:25.695 --> 00:23:28.657
[low growl resonating]

277
00:23:36.206 --> 00:23:39.459
-[unsettling music grows]
-[spectral voices whispering]

278
00:23:56.059 --> 00:23:58.812
[growling resonating]

279
00:23:59.938 --> 00:24:04.067
[spectral voice echoing]

280
00:24:17.289 --> 00:24:21.543
[spectral voice echoing]

281
00:24:21.626 --> 00:24:23.837
-[groans]
-[spectral screaming]

282
00:24:27.090 --> 00:24:29.092
[chain rattles]

283
00:24:30.010 --> 00:24:32.012
[epic rock music playing]

284
00:24:36.600 --> 00:24:38.852
-[Gu-cheon grunts]
-[howls]

285
00:24:39.519 --> 00:24:41.938
-[spectral screaming]
-[Crown Prince groans]

286
00:24:42.856 --> 00:24:44.649
[squelching]

287
00:24:44.733 --> 00:24:46.234
[spectral screams]

288
00:24:49.279 --> 00:24:50.405
[Crown Prince grunts]

289
00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:53.200
[Gu-cheon grunts]

290
00:24:54.326 --> 00:24:56.411
[grunting]

291
00:25:04.377 --> 00:25:07.214
[both grunt. groan]

292
00:25:23.480 --> 00:25:24.606
[Crown Prince grunts]

293
00:25:27.776 --> 00:25:29.236
[Crown Prince grunts. gasps]

294
00:25:29.319 --> 00:25:30.820
[spectral scream]

295
00:25:31.696 --> 00:25:33.114
[pants]

296
00:25:43.124 --> 00:25:44.417
[spectral screaming]

297
00:25:46.211 --> 00:25:48.463
[spectral voices echoing]

298
00:25:48.547 --> 00:25:50.549
[squelching]

299
00:25:52.300 --> 00:25:54.177
[rumbling]

300
00:26:06.481 --> 00:26:08.483
[epic dramatic music playing]

301
00:26:10.652 --> 00:26:13.321
[spectral growling. screaming]

302
00:26:17.993 --> 00:26:20.287
[Gu-cheon grunts]

303
00:26:20.370 --> 00:26:21.580
[music intensifies]

304
00:26:26.793 --> 00:26:28.795
[both grunting]

305
00:26:31.715 --> 00:26:32.591
[grunts]

306
00:26:32.674 --> 00:26:34.259
[spectral growling]

307
00:26:41.891 --> 00:26:43.935
[music intensifies]

308
00:26:48.231 --> 00:26:49.691
[both grunt]

309
00:26:55.614 --> 00:26:57.198
-[spectral growl]
-[Gu-cheon grunts]

310
00:26:59.117 --> 00:27:01.077
[grunts. groans]

311
00:27:02.078 --> 00:27:03.079
[Gu-cheon grunts]

312
00:27:06.958 --> 00:27:08.960
[music swells dramatically]

313
00:27:18.345 --> 00:27:20.472
-[music subsides]
-How much longer. Your Majesty?

314
00:27:20.555 --> 00:27:22.265
End this! [echoes]

315
00:27:23.892 --> 00:27:25.143
[Gu-cheon grunts]

316
00:27:39.282 --> 00:27:43.453
[King] <i>I. the sovereign. placed you.</i>
<i>the powerless. before the blade</i>

317
00:27:43.536 --> 00:27:45.747
<i>in an attempt to stop the plague.</i>

318
00:27:47.916 --> 00:27:50.001
<i>Without your consent.</i>

319
00:27:51.044 --> 00:27:53.171
<i>I tore apart your fates.</i>

320
00:27:55.757 --> 00:27:58.718
<i>-And yet. I was unable to stop anything.</i>
-[Gu-cheon grunts]

321
00:27:59.552 --> 00:28:01.596
[King] <i>All that reaches me now</i>

322
00:28:01.680 --> 00:28:04.432
<i>are your cries.</i>
<i>filled with rage and grief.</i>

323
00:28:09.437 --> 00:28:11.690
This sin won't be washed away.

324
00:28:15.485 --> 00:28:16.653
It can't.

325
00:28:16.736 --> 00:28:19.239
[Gu-cheon gasps. groans]

326
00:28:19.322 --> 00:28:22.826
[King] <i>These words are not spoken</i>
<i>in the hope of forgiveness.</i>

327
00:28:22.909 --> 00:28:24.327
[pensive music playing]

328
00:28:24.411 --> 00:28:26.287
If you wish to…

329
00:28:29.999 --> 00:28:33.044
you may take my life this very instant.

330
00:28:36.589 --> 00:28:39.008
<i>But if life is still granted to me.</i>

331
00:28:40.510 --> 00:28:43.138
<i>those remaining after your deaths.</i>

332
00:28:44.222 --> 00:28:45.515
<i>the parents.</i>

333
00:28:46.182 --> 00:28:47.517
<i>the siblings.</i>

334
00:28:48.393 --> 00:28:49.644
<i>the children.</i>

335
00:28:49.728 --> 00:28:51.688
every stranded family…

336
00:28:54.399 --> 00:28:56.443
I will care for each one.

337
00:28:56.526 --> 00:28:58.528
[poignant string music playing]

338
00:29:01.281 --> 00:29:04.784
I do this as a promise
for the people of my nation.

339
00:29:04.868 --> 00:29:07.746
[spectral screams]

340
00:29:13.668 --> 00:29:16.296
[King] <i>And as for this sin</i>
<i>that I could not repay in this life.</i>

341
00:29:17.505 --> 00:29:20.675
I will repay again and again
in the afterlife.

342
00:29:23.887 --> 00:29:26.389
So let go of your resentment…

343
00:29:30.185 --> 00:29:31.686
and move on.

344
00:29:32.937 --> 00:29:35.356
[Crown Prince groans. coughs]

345
00:29:39.652 --> 00:29:42.113
[King] <i>Lay down your ties to this world…</i>

346
00:29:44.783 --> 00:29:46.284
<i>and depart now…</i>

347
00:29:50.205 --> 00:29:51.790
<i>for the other side.</i>

348
00:29:52.791 --> 00:29:54.793
[spectral groaning]

349
00:29:54.876 --> 00:29:56.836
[poignant string music continues]

350
00:30:19.484 --> 00:30:21.986
[coughs. pants]

351
00:30:33.206 --> 00:30:34.374
[Gu-cheon sighs]

352
00:30:34.916 --> 00:30:38.127
I waited for the plague spirits to depart.

353
00:30:38.211 --> 00:30:40.213
[chain rattles]

354
00:30:41.589 --> 00:30:43.591
[tense dramatic music playing]

355
00:30:50.098 --> 00:30:51.933
[Gu-cheon grunts]

356
00:30:54.143 --> 00:30:56.145
[music intensifies]

357
00:30:56.229 --> 00:30:58.231
[both grunting]

358
00:31:03.695 --> 00:31:05.697
[both grunting]

359
00:31:14.205 --> 00:31:15.331
[straining]

360
00:31:15.415 --> 00:31:17.208
[both grunting]

361
00:31:28.136 --> 00:31:30.138
-[Gu-cheon grunts]
-[Crown Prince gasps]

362
00:31:32.974 --> 00:31:34.058
[grunts]

363
00:31:35.935 --> 00:31:36.978
[Crown Prince moans]

364
00:31:37.770 --> 00:31:39.772
[dramatic music playing]

365
00:31:51.242 --> 00:31:53.786
[Crown Prince groans]

366
00:31:55.538 --> 00:31:58.625
[labored] It cannot end like this.
It mustn't.

367
00:32:07.634 --> 00:32:08.760
[groans]

368
00:32:11.554 --> 00:32:14.140
Is your wish
to kill your father so important?

369
00:32:15.934 --> 00:32:17.018
As for me…

370
00:32:19.312 --> 00:32:21.481
I suffered my whole life
constantly believing

371
00:32:21.564 --> 00:32:23.399
that I killed my own mother.

372
00:32:24.359 --> 00:32:26.444
I thought
I would turn into an ak-gwi if I died.

373
00:32:26.527 --> 00:32:29.948
and I forced myself to keep on living
so I wouldn't become what you are.

374
00:32:31.282 --> 00:32:35.036
Why would you go so far
as to become an ak-gwi like this?

375
00:32:44.253 --> 00:32:45.380
[Crown Prince groans]

376
00:32:57.809 --> 00:32:59.811
I wanted to be King.

377
00:33:01.562 --> 00:33:04.190
But none of it matters anymore.

378
00:33:05.274 --> 00:33:08.444
If this palace
will not have me as its King…

379
00:33:09.988 --> 00:33:11.781
Be it that everyone here…

380
00:33:11.864 --> 00:33:12.865
[grunting]

381
00:33:15.201 --> 00:33:17.620
…who live within these walls…

382
00:33:19.330 --> 00:33:20.206
[grunts]

383
00:33:20.289 --> 00:33:23.084
…and those beyond it will all die soon.

384
00:33:23.167 --> 00:33:25.211
[breathes shakily]

385
00:33:25.294 --> 00:33:26.963
I will kill the lot.

386
00:33:27.547 --> 00:33:28.965
[Crown Prince gasping]

387
00:33:31.009 --> 00:33:34.846
All this time. I've tried to avoid
obliterating souls if I could.

388
00:33:35.513 --> 00:33:37.765
[chuckles] You cannot get rid of me.

389
00:33:38.641 --> 00:33:40.518
If you obliterate someone's soul.

390
00:33:40.601 --> 00:33:44.230
then that karma
will make you an ak-gwi as well.

391
00:33:45.565 --> 00:33:46.983
[both grunt]

392
00:33:49.193 --> 00:33:51.195
-[Gu-cheon grunts]
-[Crown Prince gasps]

393
00:33:53.698 --> 00:33:54.657
[blade slices]

394
00:33:55.158 --> 00:33:56.868
I have always known that.

395
00:33:57.785 --> 00:33:59.579
However. the curse won't break.

396
00:33:59.662 --> 00:34:01.873
and the Princess will die
if I don't kill you.

397
00:34:01.956 --> 00:34:03.583
[gasping]

398
00:34:03.666 --> 00:34:06.044
From the moment I met Mother Gwi-mae.

399
00:34:06.669 --> 00:34:08.838
I was ready to become an ak-gwi!

400
00:34:08.921 --> 00:34:11.007
-[Crown Prince gasping]
-[Gu-cheon grunts]

401
00:34:17.138 --> 00:34:19.057
[groaning. gasping]

402
00:34:19.140 --> 00:34:21.142
[music intensifies]

403
00:34:34.822 --> 00:34:36.616
[music subsides]

404
00:34:37.825 --> 00:34:39.619
[stirring ethereal music playing]

405
00:35:04.060 --> 00:35:06.270
It is finally over.

406
00:35:06.354 --> 00:35:07.605
[music subsides]

407
00:35:07.688 --> 00:35:09.690
[flame roars]

408
00:35:14.153 --> 00:35:16.155
[dark ethereal music playing]

409
00:35:31.003 --> 00:35:33.005
[groaning]

410
00:35:33.589 --> 00:35:34.465
[grunts]

411
00:35:35.007 --> 00:35:37.009
[groaning]

412
00:35:46.978 --> 00:35:48.229
[King] Chief Eunuch Kim!

413
00:35:51.983 --> 00:35:52.817
Your…

414
00:36:05.788 --> 00:36:07.915
Gu-cheon!

415
00:36:07.999 --> 00:36:10.001
[spectral screaming]

416
00:36:39.739 --> 00:36:41.240
[chain rattles]

417
00:36:58.507 --> 00:37:00.509
[poignant music playing]

418
00:37:18.819 --> 00:37:21.656
I will give you all the yang energy
I have left to give.

419
00:37:28.412 --> 00:37:29.872
So you can go back.

420
00:37:59.318 --> 00:38:00.778
[spectral scream]

421
00:38:01.487 --> 00:38:03.364
[dark ethereal music playing]

422
00:38:03.447 --> 00:38:05.199
[breathing heavily]

423
00:38:14.709 --> 00:38:16.669
[panting]

424
00:38:26.053 --> 00:38:28.306
No. Gu-cheon. wake up. please.

425
00:38:28.389 --> 00:38:30.057
-[melancholy music playing]
-Gu-cheon.

426
00:38:39.608 --> 00:38:40.776
[breathing heavily]

427
00:38:44.196 --> 00:38:45.489
[Saeng-gang] Take my yang energy.

428
00:38:46.073 --> 00:38:47.408
Please take it.

429
00:38:50.661 --> 00:38:52.747
You cannot die like this.

430
00:38:53.622 --> 00:38:55.124
I will not let you go.

431
00:38:56.459 --> 00:38:57.418
Don't die.

432
00:38:59.337 --> 00:39:00.421
Don't die.

433
00:39:02.548 --> 00:39:03.507
Gu-cheon.

434
00:39:10.723 --> 00:39:12.683
I believe that is enough.

435
00:39:14.810 --> 00:39:15.853
[chain rattling]

436
00:39:19.648 --> 00:39:21.650
[distant growl]

437
00:39:30.409 --> 00:39:31.911
Since this is it.

438
00:39:33.037 --> 00:39:34.997
why don't we have some fun?

439
00:39:35.581 --> 00:39:39.001
If my soul is just going to be devoured
by a gwi-mae. then I would rather…

440
00:39:54.934 --> 00:39:56.936
[music fades]

441
00:40:01.440 --> 00:40:02.775
[man] Your Majesty.

442
00:40:02.858 --> 00:40:05.986
There have been no further reports
of plague victims.

443
00:40:06.070 --> 00:40:08.906
The appeasement rites
have all concluded without incident.

444
00:40:09.490 --> 00:40:13.035
and the public sentiment
has already recovered dramatically.

445
00:40:13.119 --> 00:40:14.578
I understand.

446
00:40:15.788 --> 00:40:17.248
You may be dismissed.

447
00:40:24.922 --> 00:40:26.173
[Chief Eunuch] Your Majesty.

448
00:40:27.466 --> 00:40:30.344
All of the strange occurrences
that happened here

449
00:40:31.303 --> 00:40:33.139
have finally disappeared.

450
00:40:36.225 --> 00:40:38.227
[stirring music playing]

451
00:40:46.735 --> 00:40:47.736
[Sukbin] Let us go.

452
00:40:59.999 --> 00:41:01.000
[Chief Eunuch] <i>However.</i>

453
00:41:02.084 --> 00:41:03.711
<i>it is said that the Queen Dowager.</i>

454
00:41:03.794 --> 00:41:05.880
<i>who has withdrawn</i>
<i>to her private residence.</i>

455
00:41:05.963 --> 00:41:08.132
<i>is no longer of sound mind.</i>

456
00:41:08.215 --> 00:41:09.550
[chuckles]

457
00:41:16.348 --> 00:41:18.476
[King] <i>And how is Prince Iksang?</i>

458
00:41:23.481 --> 00:41:25.399
[Chief Eunuch] <i>He is being</i>
<i>discreetly investigated</i>

459
00:41:25.483 --> 00:41:28.277
<i>for summoning shamans</i>
<i>and using them to commit sorcery</i>

460
00:41:28.360 --> 00:41:31.363
<i>to harm you and the royal family.</i>
<i>Your Majesty.</i>

461
00:41:34.617 --> 00:41:35.743
Very well. then.

462
00:41:36.619 --> 00:41:37.953
You may be dismissed.

463
00:41:39.788 --> 00:41:41.457
It has been three days.

464
00:41:45.211 --> 00:41:47.379
[music fades]

465
00:41:50.883 --> 00:41:52.051
Princess.

466
00:41:54.887 --> 00:41:58.307
Should we not give up now
and lay Gu-cheon to rest?

467
00:42:01.393 --> 00:42:03.062
[Ji-yul sobs]

468
00:42:03.145 --> 00:42:05.314
Last time. we thought he was dead as well.

469
00:42:06.357 --> 00:42:07.900
Yet he survived that.

470
00:42:08.400 --> 00:42:10.611
Even if it is Gu-cheon…

471
00:42:13.989 --> 00:42:18.369
Everyone is saying he is dead.
are they not?

472
00:42:18.953 --> 00:42:20.996
[Ji-yul crying]

473
00:42:21.080 --> 00:42:22.540
You can stop crying.

474
00:42:25.042 --> 00:42:26.001
He is not dead.

475
00:42:26.085 --> 00:42:27.878
[crying continues]

476
00:42:34.635 --> 00:42:35.886
[door opens]

477
00:42:37.805 --> 00:42:38.889
[door closes]

478
00:42:40.266 --> 00:42:41.600
See what you've done?

479
00:42:43.936 --> 00:42:45.521
You've even made her cry.

480
00:42:46.897 --> 00:42:51.277
So please stop boiling inside.
and return to yourself at once.

481
00:42:57.116 --> 00:42:59.618
If you cannot find your way back to me.

482
00:43:01.620 --> 00:43:05.124
ring the bell so that I can come
and find you myself.

483
00:43:05.708 --> 00:43:07.459
[breathing shakily]

484
00:43:13.340 --> 00:43:14.967
-[clatter]
-[gasps]

485
00:43:17.970 --> 00:43:19.471
[Ggeomeoksali squeaks]

486
00:43:21.640 --> 00:43:23.642
[pensive music playing]

487
00:43:24.685 --> 00:43:25.894
Ggeomeoksali.

488
00:43:27.104 --> 00:43:30.190
That is a special one.
It's a Ggeomeoksali.

489
00:43:30.274 --> 00:43:33.485
It latches to the living. not a place.
and completely depletes their yang.

490
00:43:34.194 --> 00:43:35.946
The living. not a place.

491
00:43:38.407 --> 00:43:39.325
[gasps]

492
00:43:39.408 --> 00:43:41.035
He is alive.

493
00:43:42.786 --> 00:43:44.830
[breathing heavily]

494
00:43:55.591 --> 00:43:58.636
[Gu-cheon] <i>About 2.000 yards</i>
<i>to the southeast of the temple.</i>

495
00:43:58.719 --> 00:44:01.138
<i>there's a river</i>
<i>that runs along a sheer cliff.</i>

496
00:44:04.266 --> 00:44:05.601
<i>Right near there</i>

497
00:44:06.685 --> 00:44:08.062
<i>is where my mother died.</i>

498
00:44:08.145 --> 00:44:09.688
[breathing heavily]

499
00:44:09.772 --> 00:44:12.608
[Gu-cheon] <i>So even in death.</i>
<i>I cannot leave the temple.</i>

500
00:44:14.693 --> 00:44:16.320
[breathes heavily]

501
00:44:27.748 --> 00:44:28.749
Please…

502
00:44:30.042 --> 00:44:32.044
[breathes shakily]

503
00:44:38.717 --> 00:44:40.719
[music fades]

504
00:44:41.261 --> 00:44:42.429
[bell jingling]

505
00:44:42.513 --> 00:44:43.597
[gasps gently]

506
00:44:45.724 --> 00:44:47.643
-[bell jingles]
-[gasps]

507
00:44:48.894 --> 00:44:50.896
[gasps. sniffles]

508
00:44:53.524 --> 00:44:54.775
I knew you would be here.

509
00:44:57.861 --> 00:44:59.863
[breathing heavily]

510
00:45:04.493 --> 00:45:06.245
It's all in the past now.

511
00:45:09.248 --> 00:45:11.500
You can leave the palace if you'd like.

512
00:45:13.293 --> 00:45:15.003
[voice breaks] You can escape now.

513
00:45:15.796 --> 00:45:17.131
[sobs] So please.

514
00:45:18.507 --> 00:45:20.259
do not stay here alone!

515
00:45:22.261 --> 00:45:23.804
Come back with me.

516
00:45:26.432 --> 00:45:29.601
You once told me you were living
without purpose. unable to die.

517
00:45:30.102 --> 00:45:30.978
Then live.

518
00:45:33.021 --> 00:45:35.691
You can live like a spirit still among us.

519
00:45:37.234 --> 00:45:38.235
Just live!

520
00:45:42.156 --> 00:45:44.032
Are you listening to me at all?

521
00:45:45.617 --> 00:45:46.618
[sobs]

522
00:45:47.453 --> 00:45:48.954
[crying]

523
00:45:59.757 --> 00:46:01.759
[poignant music playing]

524
00:46:14.897 --> 00:46:17.357
Apparently. your life mattered
more than anything. Gu-Cheon.

525
00:46:17.441 --> 00:46:18.901
You told me that!

526
00:46:20.986 --> 00:46:23.572
Did you think
I would be glad about what you did?

527
00:46:26.158 --> 00:46:28.202
That you met your end to save me?

528
00:46:32.164 --> 00:46:33.540
[crying]

529
00:46:47.387 --> 00:46:48.639
You bastard.

530
00:46:50.307 --> 00:46:53.727
Come back this instant. Gu-cheon.
or I'll drag you out!

531
00:46:53.811 --> 00:46:57.022
[sobbing]

532
00:47:05.447 --> 00:47:06.949
[water splashing]

533
00:47:22.256 --> 00:47:24.424
[gasping]

534
00:47:24.508 --> 00:47:26.510
[bells jingling]

535
00:47:26.593 --> 00:47:28.595
[stirring music playing]

536
00:48:11.263 --> 00:48:12.472
[sobs]

537
00:48:18.186 --> 00:48:20.188
[crying]

538
00:48:26.320 --> 00:48:28.030
-[Gu-cheon moans]
-[bell jingles]

539
00:48:29.781 --> 00:48:31.783
[Gu-cheon moaning]

540
00:48:39.750 --> 00:48:40.959
[Gu-cheon] You're crying again.

541
00:48:45.505 --> 00:48:47.758
-[breathing heavily]
-[poignant music playing]

542
00:48:52.471 --> 00:48:54.473
[crying]

543
00:49:21.291 --> 00:49:22.793
[music fades]

544
00:49:22.876 --> 00:49:24.503
[door opens]

545
00:49:30.884 --> 00:49:33.095
So you managed to return to us.

546
00:49:35.597 --> 00:49:37.557
Have you prepared to leave here yet?

547
00:49:38.308 --> 00:49:39.685
Yes. Your Majesty.

548
00:49:42.312 --> 00:49:43.480
However.

549
00:49:45.107 --> 00:49:47.192
it's quite the send-off
you have made for me.

550
00:49:51.238 --> 00:49:55.367
I take it you have no intention
of letting me go easily.

551
00:49:55.867 --> 00:49:58.537
I am aware of a few matters.

552
00:50:00.831 --> 00:50:04.835
Matters that you experienced here
in the palace that you shouldn't have.

553
00:50:06.378 --> 00:50:08.839
You know far too many secrets now.

554
00:50:11.174 --> 00:50:14.386
Secrets about the palace and myself.

555
00:50:20.642 --> 00:50:21.560
Stand up.

556
00:50:22.144 --> 00:50:23.145
[scoffs]

557
00:50:26.815 --> 00:50:28.942
They say one changes entering the outhouse

558
00:50:30.402 --> 00:50:32.112
and when they leave it.

559
00:50:33.572 --> 00:50:36.491
You must know. your word weighs
very little. Your Majesty.

560
00:50:36.575 --> 00:50:37.868
[scoffs]

561
00:50:44.249 --> 00:50:46.251
[uneasy music playing]

562
00:50:51.131 --> 00:50:53.050
Is there something else you can see?

563
00:50:55.761 --> 00:50:57.095
I can see

564
00:50:58.346 --> 00:51:00.682
the souls of the departed King
and of the countless Princes

565
00:51:00.766 --> 00:51:02.893
who will never ascend to be Kings.

566
00:51:06.646 --> 00:51:08.648
[uneasy music continues]

567
00:51:11.485 --> 00:51:13.487
[spectral voices echoing]

568
00:51:21.036 --> 00:51:22.287
You may leave.

569
00:51:22.996 --> 00:51:24.456
Are you freeing me?

570
00:51:26.625 --> 00:51:27.793
[King groans]

571
00:51:32.005 --> 00:51:33.799
Only time will tell.

572
00:51:42.891 --> 00:51:44.267
[door opens]

573
00:51:51.441 --> 00:51:52.567
[door closes]

574
00:51:56.738 --> 00:52:00.450
He won't change his mind and kill me now.
will he? Mm?

575
00:52:04.663 --> 00:52:05.789
[sighs]

576
00:52:12.003 --> 00:52:13.713
[breathes deeply]

577
00:52:13.797 --> 00:52:15.549
[Saeng-gang]
Why are you still standing there?

578
00:52:20.595 --> 00:52:22.722
You can't still be attached to the palace.

579
00:52:22.806 --> 00:52:23.723
[scoffs]

580
00:52:25.433 --> 00:52:26.518
Are you leaving too?

581
00:52:27.602 --> 00:52:29.271
I've decided to come with you.

582
00:52:29.354 --> 00:52:30.355
Huh?

583
00:52:31.439 --> 00:52:32.274
Why would you?

584
00:52:41.741 --> 00:52:44.578
You went out of your way
to help me settle my affairs.

585
00:52:45.745 --> 00:52:47.622
It's my turn now to help you.

586
00:52:49.332 --> 00:52:50.667
Heavens above.

587
00:52:52.043 --> 00:52:53.253
[Gu-cheon sighs]

588
00:52:56.673 --> 00:52:57.924
It will be very hard.

589
00:52:58.008 --> 00:52:59.509
[intriguing music playing]

590
00:52:59.593 --> 00:53:01.970
Don't whine to me later
about how hard it will be for you.

591
00:53:07.601 --> 00:53:08.560
[Saeng-gang] Let us go.

592
00:53:10.228 --> 00:53:12.105
[exciting percussive music playing]

593
00:53:12.189 --> 00:53:13.398
[Gu-cheon scoffs]

594
00:53:35.879 --> 00:53:36.963
[purrs]

595
00:53:42.886 --> 00:53:44.888
[spectral screaming]

596
00:53:48.016 --> 00:53:50.227
[eerie music stinger]

597
00:53:50.310 --> 00:53:55.232
THE EAST PALACE

598
00:53:55.315 --> 00:53:57.317
{\an8}[exciting percussive music resumes]

599
00:55:44.966 --> 00:55:46.426
[music fades]

600
00:55:46.509 --> 00:55:48.511
[stirring string music playing]

601
00:56:52.117 --> 00:56:53.743
[music fades]

602
00:56:54.305 --> 00:57:54.638
